& [PositiveCase]
  + this is a real EVO-X2 installation and four-process deterministic execution rather than a synthetic or local-only claim
  + package and evidence have independent verifiers and both replay successfully under two PowerShell implementations
  + conservation accounts for the completed pilot three historical services pinned provider and absence of persistent planner processes

& [ChallengeCase]
  + the installed component is a bounded one-shot plan compiler not yet a physical build executor daemon agent loop self-updater SOP generator or model-inference service
  +86ms first and8ms second compiler timings show warm-process conditions but two samples are insufficient for throughput or comparative-performance claims
  + the provider was observed solely as protected state; no Needle or other LLM inference was requested or tested by this contract
  + Git text representation adds one terminal LF to six transport records so transport hashes and repository hashes are intentionally distinct

& [Resolution]
  + retain five unresolved facts and require a new source-preserved satisfaction-signed successor before source transfer workspace creation toolchain observation Cargo execution or build receipt sealing
  + expose LF normalization only through an explicit verifier switch and reconstruct exact transport bytes before native replay or receipt digest validation
  + treat the installed root as immutable evidence-bearing runtime material and require an independently governed uninstall or replacement contract for changes

& [Decision]
  + approve live completion and publication for Plan-Only Build Job P0; do not promote it to autonomous Cantor-host or physical-build completion
